---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Tina Dahl">
  <main class="page about-page">

    <div class="about-image">
      <img
        src="/images/tina.jpg"
        alt="Tina Dahl"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">

      <div class="about-text">
        <p>Hi,</p>
        <p>
          I’m Tina. Originally from Norway, I spent over twelve years
          working in hospitality before moving into digital design.
          I also designed the typeface you’re reading right now.
          After years of creating online experiences, I found my way
          back to the physical world through photography and film.
        </p>

        <p>
          Having travelled extensively for more than a decade, I know what
          makes a place memorable — not just visually, but emotionally. My work
          focuses on capturing the details, atmosphere and quiet moments that
          define exceptional stays.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>
</Base>
